{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785758278693,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_HehabVKbe0xn0kjLXQttTk7K","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-config.json\n+{\n+  \"topic\": \"Audit the mcp-webflow skill packet for overly concise or missing Webflow MCP 2.0 logic across references, assets, feature catalog, and manual testing playbook.\",\n+  \"maxIterations\": 5,\n+  \"minIterations\": 3,\n+  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.05,\n+  \"antiConvergence\": {\n+    \"minIterations\": 3,\n+    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n+    \"stopPolicy\": \"max-iterations\",\n+    \"divergent\": {}\n+  },\n+  \"stuckThreshold\": 3,\n+  \"minIdeaObservations\": 2,\n+  \"maxDurationMinutes\": 120,\n+  \"maxToolCallsPerIteration\": 12,\n+  \"maxMinutesPerIteration\": 10,\n+  \"progressiveSynthesis\": true,\n+  \"specFolder\": \".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\n+  \"fanout_lineage_artifact_dir\": \".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast\",\n+  \"resource_map_present\": false,\n+  \"resource_map\": {\n+    \"emit\": true\n+  },\n+  \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-03T11:56:40Z\",\n+  \"status\": \"initialized\",\n+  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n+  \"executor\": {\n+    \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n+    \"model\": \"openai/gpt-5.6-sol-fast\",\n+    \"configDir\": null,\n+    \"reasoningEffort\": \"high\",\n+    \"serviceTier\": null,\n+    \"sandboxMode\": null,\n+    \"timeoutSeconds\": 900,\n+    \"governor\": null,\n+    \"liveTools\": {\n+      \"webSearch\": \"inherit\"\n+    }\n+  },\n+  \"lineage\": {\n+    \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\n+    \"parentSessionId\": null,\n+    \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n+    \"allowedModes\": [\"new\", \"resume\", \"restart\"],\n+    \"deferredModes\": [\"fork\", \"completed-continue\"],\n+    \"generation\": 1,\n+    \"continuedFromRun\": null\n+  },\n+  \"reducer\": {\n+    \"enabled\": true,\n+    \"version\": \"1.0\",\n+    \"registryFile\": \"findings-registry.json\",\n+    \"dashboardFile\": \"deep-research-dashboard.md\",\n+    \"strategyFile\": \"deep-research-strategy.md\",\n+    \"machineOwnedSections\": [\n+      \"key-questions\",\n+      \"answered-questions\",\n+      \"what-worked\",\n+      \"what-failed\",\n+      \"exhausted-approaches\",\n+      \"ruled-out-directions\",\n+      \"divergence-frontier\",\n+      \"next-focus\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"pauseSentinelPath\": \".deep-research-pause\",\n+  \"archiveRoot\": \"_archive\",\n+  \"fileProtection\": {\n+    \"deep-research-config.json\": \"immutable\",\n+    \"deep-research-state.jsonl\": \"append-only\",\n+    \"deep-research-strategy.md\": \"mutable\",\n+    \"deep-research-dashboard.md\": \"auto-generated\",\n+    \"findings-registry.json\": \"auto-generated\",\n+    \"iteration-*.md\": \"write-once\",\n+    \"research.md\": \"mutable\"\n+  }\n+}\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-state.jsonl\n+{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"Audit the mcp-webflow skill packet for overly concise or missing Webflow MCP 2.0 logic across references, assets, feature catalog, and manual testing playbook.\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"minIterations\":3,\"convergenceThreshold\":0.05,\"antiConvergence\":{\"convergenceMode\":\"default\",\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"divergent\":{}},\"minIdeaObservations\":2,\"resource_map_present\":false,\"resource_map\":{\"emit\":true},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T11:56:40Z\",\"specFolder\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\"artifactDir\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\"generation\":1,\"nextRunAt\":null,\"remainingDelayMs\":null}\n+{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"spec_check_result\",\"folder_state\":\"spec-present-read-only\",\"normalized_topic\":\"audit the mcp-webflow skill packet for overly concise or missing webflow mcp 2.0 logic across references assets feature catalog and manual testing playbook\",\"specPath\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/spec.md\",\"writeback\":\"skipped-by-lineage-scope\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-03T11:56:40Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\"generation\":1}\n*** Add File: .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md\n+# Deep Research Strategy: mcp-webflow Quality Gaps\n+\n+## 1. Research Topic\n+\n+Audit `.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow` for overly concise or missing Webflow MCP 2.0 logic across references, assets, feature-catalog cards, and the 17-scenario manual-testing playbook.\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n+## 2. Key Questions\n+\n+- [ ] Q1: Does the local packet accurately and sufficiently describe its own tool inventory, safety boundaries, payloads, and local-versus-remote reconciliation?\n+- [ ] Q2: Does it cover the official Designer canvas, Bridge App, element-tree, component, style, variable-mode, and breakpoint semantics deeply enough for reliable execution?\n+- [ ] Q3: Does it cover CMS drafts, sites/pages, publish/branches, scripts, forms, localization, assets/compression, webhooks, and enterprise behavior deeply enough?\n+- [ ] Q4: Does it cover AI tools, agent instructions, WHTML, utility tools, rate limits, and remote-only/local-OSS differences without overclaiming support?\n+- [ ] Q5: Do the nine feature cards plus root and all 17 manual scenarios trace to the important official behavior, edge cases, and failure modes?\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n+\n+## 3. Non-Goals\n+\n+- Do not implement fixes or modify the audited skill packet.\n+- Do not authenticate to or mutate a live Webflow workspace.\n+- Do not infer remote tools solely from the local OSS repository when official remote documentation differs.\n+\n+## 4. Stop Conditions\n+\n+- Complete exactly five iterations because `stopPolicy=max-iterations`.\n+- Every reported gap must cite a local file/line or official URL.\n+- Final synthesis must classify concrete gaps as P0, P1, or P2 and recommend bounded corrections.\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n+## 5. Answered Questions\n+\n+None yet.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n+\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n+<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n+## 6. What Worked\n+\n+Pending first iteration.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n+## 7. What Failed\n+\n+Pending first iteration.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n+## 8. Exhausted Approaches\n+\n+None.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n+## 9. Ruled-Out Directions\n+\n+None.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n+## 10. Divergence Frontier\n+\n+- Completed pivots: 0\n+- Saturated directions: none\n+- Remaining frontier: all five key questions\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n+## 11. Carried-Forward Open Questions\n+\n+None yet.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n+## 12. Next Focus\n+\n+Inventory the packet, measure artifact conciseness, and map claimed coverage before comparing it with official Webflow MCP 2.0 sources.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n+\n+## 13. Known Context\n+\n+- Source pointers: `.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/references/`, `assets/`, `feature-catalog/`, and `manual-testing-playbook/`.\n+- The packet contai