========\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@\n+# Deep Research Strategy: mcp-webflow Quality Gaps\n+\n+## 1. Research Topic\n+\n+Audit `.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow` for overly concise or missing Webflow MCP 2.0 logic across references, assets, feature-catalog cards, and the 17-scenario manual-testing playbook.\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n+## 2. Key Questions\n+\n+- [ ] Q1: Does the local packet accurately and sufficiently describe its own tool inventory, safety boundaries, payloads, and local-versus-remote reconciliation?\n+- [ ] Q2: Does it cover the official Designer canvas, Bridge App, element-tree, component, style, variable-mode, and breakpoint semantics deeply enough for reliable execution?\n+- [ ] Q3: Does it cover CMS drafts, sites/pages, publish/branches, scripts, forms, localization, assets/compression, webhooks, and enterprise behavior deeply enough?\n+- [ ] Q4: Does it cover AI tools, agent instructions, WHTML, utility tools, rate limits, and remote-only/local-OSS differences without overclaiming support?\n+- [ ] Q5: Do the nine feature cards plus root and all 17 manual scenarios trace to the important official behavior, edge cases, and failure modes?\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n+\n+## 3. Non-Goals\n+\n+- Do not implement fixes or modify the audited skill packet.\n+- Do not authenticate to or mutate a live Webflow workspace.\n+- Do not infer remote tools solely from the local OSS repository when official remote documentation differs.\n+\n+## 4. Stop Conditions\n+\n+- Complete exactly five iterations because `stopPolicy=max-iterations`.\n+- Every reported gap must cite a local file/line or official URL.\n+- Final synthesis must classify concrete gaps as P0, P1, or P2 and recommend bounded corrections.\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n+## 5. Answered Questions\n+\n+None yet.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n+\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n+<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n+## 6. What Worked\n+\n+Pending first iteration.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n+## 7. What Failed\n+\n+Pending first iteration.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n+## 8. Exhausted Approaches\n+\n+None.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n+## 9. Ruled-Out Directions\n+\n+None.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n+## 10. Divergence Frontier\n+\n+- Completed pivots: 0\n+- Saturated directions: none\n+- Remaining frontier: all five key questions\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n+## 11. Carried-Forward Open Questions\n+\n+None yet.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n+\n+<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n+## 12. Next Focus\n+\n+Inventory the packet, measure artifact conciseness, and map claimed coverage before comparing it with official Webflow MCP 2.0 sources.\n+<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n+<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n+\n+## 13. Known Context\n+\n+- Source pointers: `.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/references/`, `assets/`, `feature-catalog/`, and `manual-testing-playbook/`.\n+- The packet contains five named references, two root assets plus five worked examples, nine feature cards plus a root catalog, and 17 scenario snippets plus a root playbook.\n+- `resource-map.md` is not present in the target spec; skipping the existing-map coverage gate.\n+- Spec write-back and continuity save are outside this detached lineage's authorized write root and will be recorded as skipped.\n+\n+## 14. Research Boundaries\n+\n+- Max iterations: 5\n+- Convergence threshold: 0.05 (telemetry only before iteration 5)\n+- Stop policy: max-iterations\n+- Allowed write root: `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast`\n+- Audited files are read-only.\n","additions":94,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json","relativePath":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json","type":"add","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+{\n+  \"openQuestions\": [\n+    {\"id\":\"Q1\",\"text\":\"Does the local packet accurately and sufficiently describe its own tool inventory, safety boundaries, payloads, and local-versus-remote reconciliation?\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"Q2\",\"text\":\"Does it cover official Designer and Bridge App semantics deeply enough for reliable execution?\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"Q3\",\"text\":\"Does it cover content, publishing, branches, scripts, forms, localization, assets, webhooks, and enterprise behavior deeply enough?\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"Q4\",\"text\":\"Does it cover AI tools, agent instructions, WHTML, utility tools, rate limits, and local-versus-remote differences without overclaiming?\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"Q5\",\"text\":\"Do feature cards and manual scenarios trace to important official behavior and edge cases?\"}\n+  ],\n+  \"resolvedQuestions\": [],\n+  \"keyFindings\": [],\n+  \"ruledOutDirections\": [],\n+  \"coverageBySources\": {},\n+  \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n+  \"metrics\": {\n+    \"iterationsCompleted\": 0,\n+    \"openQuestions\": 5,\n+    \"resolvedQuestions\": 0,\n+    \"keyFindings\": 0,\n+    \"convergenceScore\": 0,\n+    \"coverageBySources\": {}\n+  },\n+  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\n+  \"generation\": 1,\n+  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-03T11:56:40Z\"\n+}\n","additions":25,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-config.json\nA .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-state.jsonl\nA .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md\nA .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json","time":{"start":1785758278675,"end":1785758278691}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03bd3e6595bb440b016a70821281d881919e0e19962660c24c"}},"id":"prt_fc77c18a8001ZTyltqWOJJutVw","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","messageID":"msg_fc77bfde70018BhIeCY20PawPl"}}
