{"type":"text","timestamp":1785758321496,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"id":"prt_fc77d86bd001OX2cOn6bQyBKnI","messageID":"msg_fc77d3a11001mxH2D67g2A02lE","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","type":"text","text":"Iteration 1 found that the packet is not uniformly “too concise”: the 498-line remote action inventory is broad, but its invocation semantics and examples are thin enough to create concrete payload and classification errors. The first evidence set will record internal contradictions, incomplete payload shapes, stale scenario counts, and missing local-to-remote action crosswalks before moving to official Designer evidence.","time":{"start":1785758320317,"end":1785758321493},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_001f840f203c17f0016a7082703bd081918de998752d40ab9c","phase":"commentary"}}}}
