{"type":"text","timestamp":1785758546606,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"id":"prt_fc780f55b001Sv4W3Fs0SDUduG","messageID":"msg_fc780bcbd001tZFULe7MBh6A8M","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","type":"text","text":"Official Designer documentation confirms the packet’s high-level Bridge split, but exposes missing execution-critical details: mode-gated `ModeForbidden` behavior, `set_style` replacement semantics, component constraints and binding types, variant ordering/base rules, and breakpoint/pseudo behavior. Iteration 2 will distinguish those P1/P2 omissions from the correctly documented headless-versus-canvas boundary.","time":{"start":1785758545243,"end":1785758546604},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_01b6a8fef7fdbb3a016a708351322081919d52c4052f6a1d93","phase":"commentary"}}}}
