iter002-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Breakpoint cascade and pseudo semantics missing\",\"iteration\":2,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-002.md\"}\n   ],\n   \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n-    {\"approach\":\"Treat the packet as uniformly too concise\",\"reason\":\"The action inventory is broad; executable semantics are the actual gap.\",\"iteration\":1}\n+    {\"approach\":\"Treat the packet as uniformly too concise\",\"reason\":\"The action inventory is broad; executable semantics are the actual gap.\",\"iteration\":1},\n+    {\"approach\":\"Assume all Designer operations require the Bridge App\",\"reason\":\"Only live canvas/session state and snapshots require it.\",\"iteration\":2}\n   ],\n   \"coverageBySources\": {},\n   \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n   \"metrics\": {\n-    \"iterationsCompleted\": 1,\n-    \"openQuestions\": 5,\n-    \"resolvedQuestions\": 0,\n-    \"keyFindings\": 6,\n+    \"iterationsCompleted\": 2,\n+    \"openQuestions\": 4,\n+    \"resolvedQuestions\": 1,\n+    \"keyFindings\": 12,\n     \"convergenceScore\": 0,\n     \"coverageBySources\": {}\n   },\n   \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\n   \"generation\": 1,\n-  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-03T11:58:43Z\"\n+  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-03T12:02:29Z\"\n }\n","additions":17,"deletions":9},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","relativePath":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","type":"update","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n@@ -11,22 +11,24 @@\n \n | Run | Focus | newInfoRatio | Findings | Status |\n |---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n | 1 | Local packet coverage and conciseness | 1.00 | 6 | complete |\n+| 2 | Official Designer semantics | 0.88 | 6 | complete |\n \n ## Question Status\n \n-- 0/5 fully answered\n-- Q1 partially answered; Q2-Q5 open\n+- 1/5 fully answered\n+- Q1 partially answered; Q2 answered; Q3-Q5 open\n \n ## Convergence Trend\n \n-- Ratios: `[1.00]`\n+- Ratios: `[1.00, 0.88]`\n - Convergence is telemetry only before the hard iteration cap.\n \n ## Dead Ends\n \n - Uniform-conciseness framing eliminated; investigate semantic depth by capability.\n+- All-Designer-needs-Bridge framing eliminated; Data page-building is headless.\n \n ## Next Focus\n \n-Official Designer canvas, Bridge App, element, component, style, variable-mode, and breakpoint semantics.\n+Official CMS, publishing, branches, scripts, forms, localization, assets/compression, webhooks, and enterprise semantics.\n","additions":6,"deletions":4},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log","relativePath":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log","type":"update","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log\n@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@\n {\"event\":\"started\",\"label\":\"sol-high-fast\",\"at\":\"2026-08-03T11:56:40Z\",\"duration_ms\":0,\"loop_type\":\"research\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\"generation\":1,\"gauges\":{\"iterations\":0,\"elapsed_ms\":0,\"score\":0}}\n {\"event\":\"progress\",\"label\":\"sol-high-fast\",\"at\":\"2026-08-03T11:58:43Z\",\"duration_ms\":123000,\"loop_type\":\"research\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\"generation\":1,\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"gauges\":{\"iterations\":1,\"elapsed_ms\":123000,\"score\":1.0}}\n+{\"event\":\"progress\",\"label\":\"sol-high-fast\",\"at\":\"2026-08-03T12:02:29Z\",\"duration_ms\":349000,\"loop_type\":\"research\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\"generation\":1,\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"gauges\":{\"iterations\":2,\"elapsed_ms\":349000,\"score\":0.88}}\n","additions":1,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md\nM .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json\nM .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\nM .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/line