{"type":"text","timestamp":1785758766215,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"id":"prt_fc78451b1001Bjw4FSi07nlOQv","messageID":"msg_fc7841d4e001642o12sOUSPdX7","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","type":"text","text":"The content/operations pass found another pattern: the packet usually names the right actions but omits lifecycle constraints that change safety and retry behavior. High-impact examples include two-step asset upload and irreversible soft deletion, replace-all script operations, secondary-locale-only writes, hidden-field-only form updates, and the absence of any MCP branch-merge action.","time":{"start":1785758765489,"end":1785758766213},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0ac32c72b0495dc8016a70842d70fc819196ad44b1e2b099de","phase":"commentary"}}}}
