md\"},\n-    {\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Breakpoint cascade and pseudo semantics missing\",\"iteration\":2,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-002.md\"}\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Breakpoint cascade and pseudo semantics missing\",\"iteration\":2,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-002.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Asset lifecycle logic materially incomplete\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Script effect model and gating inconsistent\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Localization constraints missing\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Form mutation scope too broad\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"title\":\"Branch merge boundary omitted\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Endpoint limits and cardinalities missing\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"},\n+    {\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"Rate guidance lacks budget and polling semantics\",\"iteration\":3,\"source\":\"iterations/iteration-003.md\"}\n   ],\n   \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n     {\"approach\":\"Treat the packet as uniformly too concise\",\"reason\":\"The action inventory is broad; executable semantics are the actual gap.\",\"iteration\":1},\n-    {\"approach\":\"Assume all Designer operations require the Bridge App\",\"reason\":\"Only live canvas/session state and snapshots require it.\",\"iteration\":2}\n+    {\"approach\":\"Assume all Designer operations require the Bridge App\",\"reason\":\"Only live canvas/session state and snapshots require it.\",\"iteration\":2},\n+    {\"approach\":\"Assume remote CMS create/update writes are immediately live\",\"reason\":\"Remote create/update actions produce drafts and publish separately.\",\"iteration\":3}\n   ],\n   \"coverageBySources\": {},\n   \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n   \"metrics\": {\n-    \"iterationsCompleted\": 2,\n-    \"openQuestions\": 4,\n-    \"resolvedQuestions\": 1,\n-    \"keyFindings\": 12,\n+    \"iterationsCompleted\": 3,\n+    \"openQuestions\": 3,\n+    \"resolvedQuestions\": 2,\n+    \"keyFindings\": 19,\n     \"convergenceScore\": 0,\n     \"coverageBySources\": {}\n   },\n   \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk\",\n   \"generation\": 1,\n-  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-03T12:02:29Z\"\n+  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-08-03T12:06:07Z\"\n }\n","additions":16,"deletions":8},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","relativePath":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","type":"update","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md\n@@ -12,23 +12,26 @@\n | Run | Focus | newInfoRatio | Findings | Status |\n |---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n | 1 | Local packet coverage and conciseness | 1.00 | 6 | complete |\n | 2 | Official Designer semantics | 0.88 | 6 | complete |\n+| 3 | Content and operational semantics | 0.82 | 7 | complete |\n \n ## Question Status\n \n-- 1/5 fully answered\n-- Q1 partially answered; Q2 answered; Q3-Q5 open\n+- 2/5 fully answered\n+- Q1 partially answered; Q2-Q3 answered; Q4-Q5 open\n \n ## Convergence Trend\n \n-- Ratios: `[1.00, 0.88]`\n+- Ratios: `[1.00, 0.88, 0.82]`\n+- Rolling average: 0.90, above 0.05; convergence vote CONTINUE.\n - Convergence is telemetry only before the hard iteration cap.\n \n ## Dead Ends\n \n - Uniform-conciseness framing eliminated; investigate semantic depth by capability.\n - All-Designer-needs-Bridge framing eliminated; Data page-building is headless.\n+- Remote-CMS-is-live framing eliminated; remote creates/updates drafts.\n \n ## Next Focus\n \n-Official CMS, publishing, branches, scripts, forms, localization, assets/compression, webhooks, and enterprise semantics.\n+AI tools, Agent Instructions/resources, WHTML, utility discovery, official limitations, and surface migration/reconciliation.\n","additions":7,"deletions":4},{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log","relativePath":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log","type":"update","patch":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quali