# Prompt\n37: \n38: - Prompt: `Update the 'About' page title in the test site (draft).`\n39: \n40: ### Commands\n41: \n42: 1. `list_tools()`. 2. `update_page_settings` (draft). 3. Verify no publish receipt.\n43: \n44: ### Expected\n45: \n46: Before-state captured; settings updated; no publish-status flip.\n47: \n48: ### Evidence\n49: \n50: Before/after settings, no publish receipt.\n51: \n52: ### Pass / Fail\n53: \n54: - **Pass**: if updated as DW with no publish\n55: - **Fail**: if the status flipped without a PB gate\n56: \n57: ### Failure Triage\n58: \n59: 1. Review the update_page_settings payload. 2. Confirm no publish intent.\n60: \n61: ---\n62: \n63: ## 4. SOURCE FILES\n64: \n65: ### Playbook Sources\n66: \n67: | File | Role |\n68: |---|---|\n69: | `manual-testing-playbook.md` | Root directory page and scenario summary |\n70: | `../../feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md` | Feature-catalog source describing the implementation contract |\n71: \n72: ### Implementation And Test Anchors\n73: \n74: | File | Role |\n75: |---|---|\n76: | `../../references/action-reference.md` | Action inventory with classes |\n77: | `../../SKILL.md` | Frozen classes and gates |\n78: \n79: ---\n80: \n81: ## 5. SOURCE METADATA\n82: \n83: - Group: Draft-Write\n84: - Playbook ID: DRAFT-001\n85: - Canonical root source: `manual-testing-playbook.md`\n86: - Feature file path: `draft-write/draftset.md`\n\n(End of file - total 86 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: \"DRAFT-001 -- Draft page settings update\"\ndescription: \"DW page settings update without publish-status change.\"\nstage: routing\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# DRAFT-001 -- Draft page settings update\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis scenario validates Draft page settings update for `DRAFT-001`. It focuses on DW page settings update without publish-status change..\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nDW page settings update without publish-status change.\n\n---\n\n## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/manual-testing-playbook/draft-write/draftset.md","text":"---\ntitle: \"DRAFT-001 -- Draft page settings update\"\ndescription: \"DW page settings update without publish-status change.\"\nstage: routing\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# DRAFT-001 -- Draft page settings update\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nThis scenario validates Draft page settings update for `DRAFT-001`. It focuses on DW page settings update without publish-status change..\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nDW page settings update without publish-status change.\n\n---\n\n## 2. SCENARIO CONTRACT\n\nOperators run the exact prompt and command sequence for `DRAFT-001` and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\n\n- Objective: DW page settings update without publish-status change.\n- Real user request: `Update the 'About' page title in the test site (draft).`\n- Prompt: `Update the 'About' page title in the test site (draft).`\n- Expected execution process: Discover, classify DW, capture before-state, send the draft payload, verify no status flip.\n- Expected signals: Before-state captured; settings updated; no publish-status flip.\n- Desired user-visible outcome: Updated settings with a before/after record and no publish.\n- Pass/fail: PASS if updated as DW with no publish; FAIL if the status flipped without a PB gate.\n\n---\n\n## 3. TEST EXECUTION\n\n### Prompt\n\n- Prompt: `Update the 'About' page title in the test site (draft).`\n\n### Commands\n\n1. `list_tools()`. 2. `update_page_settings` (draft). 3. Verify no publish receipt.\n\n### Expected\n\nBefore-state captured; settings updated; no publish-status flip.\n\n### Evidence\n\nBefore/after settings, no publish receipt.\n\n### Pass / Fail\n\n- **Pass**: if updated as DW with no publish\n- **Fail**: if the status flipped without a PB gate\n\n### Failure Triage\n\n1. Review the update_page_settings payload. 2. Confirm no publish intent.\n\n---\n\n## 4. SOURCE FILES\n\n### Playbook Sources\n\n| File | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `manual-testing-playbook.md` | Root directory page and scenario summary |\n| `../../feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md` | Feature-catalog source describing the implementation contract |\n\n### Implementation And Test Anchors\n\n| File | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `../../references/action-reference.md` | Action inventory with classes |\n| `../../SKILL.md` | Frozen classes and gates |\n\n---\n\n## 5. SOURCE METADATA\n\n- Group: Draft-Write\n- Playbook ID: DRAFT-001\n- Canonical root source: `manual-testing-playbook.md`\n- Feature file path: `draft-write/draftset.md`","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":86,"totalLines":86,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/manual-testing-playbook/draft-write/draftset.md","time":{"start":1785759305317,"end":1785759305324}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0ec5ddbc42ad6d4e016a70864899ec8191823e932c71f1e300"}},"id":"prt_fc78c8e47001Qea1W1QisXgt9f","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","messageID":"msg_fc78c3a4d001Rbgzn9mcffJkoK"}}
