{"type":"text","timestamp":1785759323786,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"id":"prt_fc78cd116001n41sRtNWoqmd1y","messageID":"msg_fc78c986e001y7W8eiBwkVvHQY","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","type":"text","text":"The final traceability pass confirms the requested snippets are materially under-specified, not merely compact. Several feature cards contain current-surface falsehoods or invented actions, and the playbook can pass while missing the most important hazards: Agent Instruction precedence, replace-all styles, mode errors, component/variant invariants, assets/localization/forms/WHTML, and version-aware tool migration.","time":{"start":1785759322390,"end":1785759323784},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_08829aa1eb157682016a70865a62e881918d98f1c04bc08faf","phase":"commentary"}}}}
