ents actions\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-instruction-test-gap\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Instruction test misses trust boundary\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-designer-test-gap\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Designer test misses replace-all styles\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-scenario-coverage\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Major capability families untested\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-trace-1\",\"source\":\"f-false-variant-card\",\"target\":\"q-traceability\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-trace-2\",\"source\":\"f-instruction-test-gap\",\"target\":\"q-traceability\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-trace-3\",\"source\":\"f-designer-test-gap\",\"target\":\"q-traceability\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-trace-4\",\"source\":\"f-scenario-coverage\",\"target\":\"q-traceability\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-001\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Component-variants card invents actions\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"feature-catalog/design/component-variants.md:18-44\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/tools/data-tools.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-002\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Localization/fonts/forms card contains unsupported capabilities\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"feature-catalog/content/localization-fonts-forms.md:11-55\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/faqs.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-003\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Designer card mixes v1.3 names with v2.0.1 behavior\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"feature-catalog/design/designer.md:19-93\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/skills/skill-migration.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-004\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Publish cards conflate CMS and site publish semantics\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"feature-catalog/content/cms.md:20-45\",\"feature-catalog/content/publish-deploy.md:20-37\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-005\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Agent Instructions scenario misses P0 precedence boundary\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"manual-testing-playbook/draft-write/instructions.md:20-59\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-006\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Designer scenario can pass after destructive style replacement\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"manual-testing-playbook/designer-edit/designer-edit.md:20-59\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/tools/data-tools.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-007\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Count-based surface reconciliation can falsely pass\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"manual-testing-playbook/discovery-setup/remote-surface.md:20-59\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/skills/skill-migration.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-008\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Rate-limit scenario intentionally abuses real API\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"manual-testing-playbook/safety-gate/rate-limit.md:20-59\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/data/v2.0.0/reference/rate-limits.md\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-009\",\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"Major capability families and failure modes untested\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:99-119\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-010\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"Catalog/test metadata contains broken links and weak assertions\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:61-77\",\"feature-catalog/design/designer.md:1-19\"]}\n+{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treat 17 scenarios as comprehensive MCP 2.0 coverage\",\"reason\":\"Operation-class coverage omits most capability-specific invariants and advanced failures.\",\"iteration\":5}\n*** Update File: .opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-sta