\n38: \n39: Feature-card and 17-scenario traceability against all identified gaps.\n\n(End of file - total 39 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Deep Research Dashboard\n\n## Lifecycle\n\n- Session: `fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk`\n- Generation: 1\n- Status: iterating\n- Stop policy: max-iterations (5)\n\n## Iteration Table\n\n| Run | Focus | newInfoRatio | Findings | Status |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n| 1 | Local packet coverage and conciseness | 1.00 | 6 | complete |\n| 2 | Official Designer semantics | 0.88 | 6 | complete |\n| 3 | Content and operational semantics | 0.82 | 7 | complete |\n| 4 | Advanced surfaces and version reconciliation | 0.91 | 9 | insight |\n\n## Question Status\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","text":"# Deep Research Dashboard\n\n## Lifecycle\n\n- Session: `fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk`\n- Generation: 1\n- Status: iterating\n- Stop policy: max-iterations (5)\n\n## Iteration Table\n\n| Run | Focus | newInfoRatio | Findings | Status |\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n| 1 | Local packet coverage and conciseness | 1.00 | 6 | complete |\n| 2 | Official Designer semantics | 0.88 | 6 | complete |\n| 3 | Content and operational semantics | 0.82 | 7 | complete |\n| 4 | Advanced surfaces and version reconciliation | 0.91 | 9 | insight |\n\n## Question Status\n\n- 4/5 fully answered\n- Q1-Q4 answered; Q5 open\n\n## Convergence Trend\n\n- Ratios: `[1.00, 0.88, 0.82, 0.91]`\n- Rolling average (last 3): 0.87, above 0.05; convergence vote CONTINUE.\n- Convergence is telemetry only before the hard iteration cap.\n\n## Dead Ends\n\n- Uniform-conciseness framing eliminated; investigate semantic depth by capability.\n- All-Designer-needs-Bridge framing eliminated; Data page-building is headless.\n- Remote-CMS-is-live framing eliminated; remote creates/updates drafts.\n- Transport-only surface-difference framing eliminated; migration changes behavior and inputs.\n\n## Next Focus\n\nFeature-card and 17-scenario traceability against all identified gaps.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":39,"totalLines":39,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1785759502902,"end":1785759502910}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c4659aac3da035e016a70870e889881918e8e94b9cd3eaa94"}},"id":"prt_fc78f91fe001wwv6kRCXN4ENn0","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","messageID":"msg_fc78f62f8001pXXLkVYcYeoixJ"}}
