{"type":"text","timestamp":1785759674195,"sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","part":{"id":"prt_fc791c29c001bPA668eIh9Sjwo","messageID":"msg_fc7918e75001mL6z1TZoWVXrbu","sessionID":"ses_0388746e7ffeyzxby3g9rdx78Q","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Complete a five-iteration detached deep-research audit of `.opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow`.\n- Write and validate all artifacts only under the `sol-high-fast` lineage, then return `FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:sol-high-fast`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Write boundary: `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast`.\n- Session: `fanout-sol-high-fast-1785758004736-mkvlvk`.\n- Executor: `cli-opencode`, model `openai/gpt-5.6-sol-fast`, reasoning `high`.\n- Current process is already the requested detached CLI executor; nested `opencode run` is blocked by `SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK=cli-opencode`.\n- Stop policy is `max-iterations`; ratios were `1.00, 0.88, 0.82, 0.91, 0.86`, so synthesis must use `maxIterationsReached`, not convergence.\n- Spec write-back, memory save, and staging are excluded because they write outside the authorized lineage.\n- Final evidence totals: 38 findings — P0: 1, P1: 30, P2: 7.\n- P0: site-authored Agent Instructions are supplied automatically, but the packet lacks an explicit rule preventing them from overriding operator gates and safety contracts.\n- Major P1 themes: incomplete payload/schema semantics, `set_style` replace-all omission, component/variant constraints, version/tool-layout mismatch, stale local OSS baseline with `@latest`, script/asset/localization/form/branch/WHTML gaps, false feature-card actions, and missing/unsafe tests.\n- Important official sources:\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/reference/how-it-works.md`\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/tools/designer-tools.md`\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/tools/data-tools.md`\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/tools/utility-tools.md`\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/mcp/skills/skill-migration.md`\n  - `https://developers.webflow.com/data/v2.0.0/reference/rate-limits.md`\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Loaded the deep-research YAML/contracts and `cli-opencode` orchestration references.\n- Initialized config, append-only state, strategy, registry, dashboard, prompts, iterations, deltas, progressive synthesis, and status log.\n- Completed and verified iterations 1–5 using:\n  - `node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir \".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast\" --iteration N`\n- Every iteration returned `OK iteration N complete: narrative + route-proof + delta`.\n- Iteration focuses:\n  - 1: local packet coverage and conciseness.\n  - 2: official Designer semantics.\n  - 3: content and operational semantics.\n  - 4: advanced surfaces and version reconciliation.\n  - 5: feature-card and 17-scenario traceability.\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` contains all five iteration records.\n- `research.md` contains progressive findings through iteration 5.\n- Iteration-4 reducer patch initially failed with `apply_patch verification failed`; it was re-read and successfully reapplied.\n\n### Active\n- `phase_synthesis` is not yet sealed.\n- `findings-registry.json`, `deep-research-dashboard.md`, `deep-research-strategy.md`, and `orchestration-status.log` are refreshed only through iteration 4.\n- `research.md` still says progressive synthesis and needs final executive summary, severity ordering, recommendations, convergence report, and conclusion.\n- `resource-map.md` has not been emitted.\n- Final lifecycle/synthesis records have not been appended to `deep-research-state.jsonl`.\n\n### Blocked\n- No substantive blocker.\n- `.deep-research.lock` is stale because the lock CLI recorded a short-lived shell PID; `heartbeat` was invalid (`Unknown subcommand \"heartbeat\": expected acquire | status | refresh | release`) and `refresh` returned `{\"command\":\"refresh\",\"refreshed\":false}`.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Refresh final reducer-owned views: resolve Q5, add iteration-5 findings to the registry, add dashboard row 5, mark all questions answered, and append final progress status.\n2. Finalize `research.md`, emit `resource-map.md`, append `synthesis_complete` with `stopReason: \"maxIterationsReached\"`, validate JSON/JSONL and all required artifacts, clean/release the stale lock if supported, then output `FANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:sol-high-fast`.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-config.json`: immutable loop configuration.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-state.jsonl`: append-only state with five completed iterations.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-strategy.md`: strategy through iteration 4; Q5 remains open.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/findings-registry.json`: 28 findings through iteration 4; needs final 10.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md`: dashboard through iteration 4.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/research.md`: progressive synthesis containing all five iterations’ themes.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/iterations/`: five verified iteration narratives.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deltas/`: five verified JSONL deltas.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/prompts/`: five rendered iteration prompts.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/orchestration-status.log`: progress through iteration 4.\n- `.opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/.deep-research.lock`: stale advisory lock.","time":{"start":1785759646364,"end":1785759674193},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_014b7412b5a67a5a016a70879e5ca481918d606cf61a4750e0","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
