-gpt-reliability/001-research-and-diagnosis/001-gpt-behavioral-hardening-research/research/lineages/glm-max/deep-research-state.jsonl:\n  Line 33: {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"totalIterations\":30,\"answeredCount\":9,\"totalQuestions\":9,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"averageNewInfoRatio\":0.488,\"sessionId\":\"fanout-glm-max-1782886969751-3481xi\",\"generation\":1,\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-01T10:30:00Z\"}\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/028-deprecate-deep-context-integrate-capabilities/001-research-baseline-and-inventory/research/deep-research-state.jsonl:\n  Line 12: {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":10,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"iterationsCompleted\":10,\"researchOutput\":\".opencode/specs/deep-loops/035-deprecate-deep-context-integrate-capabilities/research/research.md\",\"resourceMapSkipped\":true,\"resourceMapSkipReason\":\"no delta files found\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-04T13:14:31Z\",\"sessionId\":\"rsr-2026-07-04T11-20-19Z\",\"generation\":1}\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-skill-advisor/z_archive/004-skill-graph/001-skill-graph-metadata-routing-boosts/research/deep-research-state.jsonl:\n  Line 12: {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"totalIterations\":10,\"answeredCount\":10,\"totalQuestions\":10,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-13T15:03:00.000Z\"}\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/system-deep-loop/z_archive/006-deep-skill-evolution/007-deep-stack-cross-cutting/004-doc-evolution-research-gap-backstop/research/deep-research-state.jsonl:\n  Line 6: {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"stopReason\":\"all_questions_answered\",\"totalIterations\":2,\"answeredCou