ynthesis:\n\n  Line 457:           message: \"UNSEALED_COMPLETION: reducer returned sealed=false; config status and presentation remain incomplete.\"\n\n  Line 460:         action: \"Mark the run's status complete in config.json now that synthesis has run\"\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-presentation.txt:\n  Line 66: | `resource_map_emit`     | N        | flag `--no-resource-map`, marker `resource_map_emit`, or default                                                                                                                                       | `true`                             | N                                                       |\n\n  Line 100:    |-- --no-resource-map -> config.resource_map.emit = false\n\n  Line 224: Run an iterative loop for deep research: Initialize state under `{artifact_dir}` (resolved via `resolveArtifactRoot()` — root specs use `{spec_folder}/research/`; child phases and sub-phases use `{spec_folder}/research/{packet}-pt-{NN}/`), dispatch `@deep-research` agent per iteration, evaluate convergence, synthesize findings into `{artifact_dir}/research.md`, and emit `{artifact_dir}/resource-map.md` at convergence unless `--no-resource-map` disables it. Use when deep investigation requiring multiple rounds of discovery.\n\n  Line 229: **Outputs:** Spec folder with `{artifact_dir}/` packet (`{spec_folder}/research/` for root specs or `{spec_folder}/research/{packet}-pt-{NN}/` for nested phases), `research.md`, optional `resource-map.md`, state files, and `STATUS=<OK|FAIL|CANCELLED>`\n\n  Line 237: | Synth | Synthesize | Emit `research/resource-map.md` and compile final research/research.md | research/resource-map.md, research/research.md (17 sections) |\n\n  Line 266: Artifacts: research/research.md, research/resource-map.md (unless `--no-resource-map`), [N] iteration files, continuity update in canonical spec docs refreshed\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-model-benchmark-auto.yaml:\n  Line 186:   phase_synthesis:\n\n  Line 197:         promotion_evidence: \"Lane B promotes on benchmark evidence. The gate is the benchmark report (report.json, or reviewer-report.json for reviewer runs, under .opencode/skills/sk-prompt/sk-prompt-models/benchmarks/{run_label}/) passed via --benchmark-report. promote-candidate.cjs runs its benchmark-mode path when --score is omitted, reads status, recommendation, target, profileId, and aggregateScore from the report, and refuses promotion unless status is benchmark-complete with a benchmark-pass recommendation and a passing aggregate and repeatability gate. There is no scored agent file and no --score argument in Lane B.\"\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml:\n  Line 110:   resource_map_output: \"{artifact_dir}/resource-map.md\"\n\n  Line 142:       After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n\n  Line 144:       phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n\n  Line 252:           completed-session: \"Resume artifacts exist and config.status == 'complete'\"\n\n  Line 280:           skip_to: phase_synthesis\n\n  Line 733:                 short_circuit: \"When status is completed or failed, skip all dispatch and record steps and bind this result as pivot_result.\"\n\n  Line 763:                     ? { status, output: {pivot_seat_001_output_json}, startedAtIso: '{pivot_seat_001_started_at_iso}', completedAtIso: '{pivot_seat_001_completed_at_iso}', durationMs: Number('{pivot_seat_001_duration_ms}') }\n\n  Line 764:                     : { status: 'rejected', error: {pivot_seat_001_error_json}, startedAtIso: '{pivot_seat_001_started_at_iso}', completedAtIso: '{pivot_seat_001_completed_at_iso}', durationMs: Number('{pivot_seat_001_duration_ms}') };\n\n  Line 797:    